    "detailed_description": "Pintaris is a multiplayer competitive puzzle game that you can draw different blocks with various paint tool to clear lines and get scores.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The rules are simple: </h2>When you almost fill 4 or more squares with blocks, you can generate blocks (some items can perform special actions to generate blocks.)  Completing a row of 10 squares horizontally can eliminate and score points. The player with the highest score within a specific time wins.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2977350/extras/524bdd8dee526464f9b710f3e520dfef.poster.avif?t=1734093674\" width=600 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2977350/extras/524bdd8dee526464f9b710f3e520dfef.webm?t=1734093674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2977350/extras/524bdd8dee526464f9b710f3e520dfef.mp4?t=1734093674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring 2 Game Modes:</h2>1. Duel: You and your opponent each have your own drawing tools, drawing blocks, clearing lines, and gaining buffes on the same field. Use strategy and technique to achieve higher scores.<br>2. 40 Lines: Single-player game mode. Try to clear literally 40 lines of blocks in a short time to get the fastest record.",
